WEBVTT

00:00:00.145 --> 00:00:06.514
Open the video part settings. Each tab changes this part of the reel.

00:00:06.514 --> 00:00:18.103
On the Frame tab, zoom in to refine the composition, then compare the result in Preview.

00:00:18.103 --> 00:00:27.039
Play the part to see the closer framing on moving footage.
